    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive into a strange and dangerous world. No explanations. Your character is as confused as you. You can help each other. You don't know why you're here or what your goal is. Survive first and figure out the rest as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.poster.avif?t=1744221013\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.webm?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.mp4?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and look out for secrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in slower paced methodical combat based around timing and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation when necessary. Gear up and come back later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new weapons, armor pieces and other useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactical and smart about managing your resources\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become powerful and face even greater challenges\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and learn hidden systems and secrets\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style of presentation with changing camera angles and dramatic framing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions from dialogues or cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of dark fantasy and cyberpunk setting in a nineties style aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >brutal and colorful cartoon violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >elves with machineguns, vampires, robots and skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some customisation options: selection of color scheme presets for the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat controls suitable for different input methods: mouse, keyboard and gaming controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.poster.avif?t=1744221013\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.webm?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.mp4?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive into a strange and dangerous world. No explanations. Your character is as confused as you. You can help each other. You don't know why you're here or what your goal is. Survive first and figure out the rest as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.poster.avif?t=1744221013\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.webm?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/9fbb3caaaf61fec67b6ec5f9e7fcda5e.mp4?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and look out for secrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in slower paced methodical combat based around timing and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation when necessary. Gear up and come back later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new weapons, armor pieces and other useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactical and smart about managing your resources\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become powerful and face even greater challenges\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and learn hidden systems and secrets\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style of presentation with changing camera angles and dramatic framing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions from dialogues or cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of dark fantasy and cyberpunk setting in a nineties style aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >brutal and colorful cartoon violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >elves with machineguns, vampires, robots and skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some customisation options: selection of color scheme presets for the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat controls suitable for different input methods: mouse, keyboard and gaming controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.poster.avif?t=1744221013\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.webm?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/ea0148c558ee23655c00e12d5a509e7a.mp4?t=1744221013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Tamara is a Dungeon Crawler with elements of Survival Horror in a Cyberpunk-Fantasy Setting. Explore dungeons, bunkers, castles and abandoned cities in search of loot and methodically fight your way against all types of monsters and machines.",
